  <h1>Test your X-300 script before it runs your heating</h1>
  <p>The ControlByWeb X-300 can run a small BASIC script, which turns it from a fixed thermostat into something you program. The catch is that the only way to see a script work is to upload it to the unit and wait. This site lets you run the script against a simulated clock, room and outside temperature first.</p>
